# Lutri, the Spellchaser copies Bot1's Kolaghan's Command, cast with "Destroy target artifact" (at Bot2's Mox Pearl) and
# "Kolaghan's Command deals 2 damage to any target" (at Bot2). The copy has the same modes, which are not chosen again
# (CR 707.10, 707.10c: no modes question), and Bot1 may choose new targets for it, a question for each mode's target in
# printed order (CR 707.10c, 115.7d, 700.2c), each judged by its own mode's words (Lutri, a creature, is no target for
# "Destroy target artifact"): the artifact becomes Bot2's Mox Jet, and the damage stays on Bot2 (a target
# may be kept). The copy resolves first and destroys Mox Jet, dealing 2 to Bot2; the original destroys Mox Pearl, dealing 2
# more. So both of Bot2's Moxen are gone and Bot2 is at 16 - had the copy been left on its old targets, Mox Jet would survive.

